Section: metapackages
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 asgard-gnome-desktop,
 cups,
 cups-pk-helper,
 simple-scan
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ printing + scanning extras
 Completes the printing + scanning story.  asgard-gnome-desktop
 ships system-config-printer-common + system-config-printer-udev
 (the configuration UI shim and udev hooks), but not the CUPS print
 server itself or scanner tooling.  This metapackage adds:
 .
   * cups               the CUPS printing server (daemon + filters)
   * cups-pk-helper     PolicyKit elevation helper so the GNOME
                        printer dialog can add/remove printers
                        without a separate root prompt
   * simple-scan        GNOME scanner / OCR-ready capture UI
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop.
